<li><strong>Math:</strong> <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?n_1%20=%203%20-%202%20+%201%20=%202"></li>
<li><strong>Meaning:</strong> We calculate the number of elements in the left pile. The left pile has 2 elements (<img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%5B4,%207%5D">).</li>
</ul></li>
<li><strong>Line 2:</strong> <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?n_2%20=%20r%20-%20q">
<ul>
<li><strong>Math:</strong> <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?n_2%20=%205%20-%203%20=%202"></li>
<li><strong>Meaning:</strong> We calculate the number of elements in the right pile. The right pile has 2 elements (<img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%5B2,%205%5D">).</li>
</ul></li>
