<li><strong>Meaning:</strong> We create two empty temporary arrays, <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?L"> (Left) and <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?R"> (Right). We make them one slot bigger than <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?n_1"> and <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?n_2"> (size 3) to make room for the special “sentinel” card at the bottom.</li>
