<td style="text-align: left;"><strong>for</strong> <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?j%20=%202"> <strong>to</strong> <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?A.length"></td>
<td style="text-align: center;"><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?c_1"></td>
